3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"Çfarë kuptimi kishte ngjyra e bardhë për Lunë?\" class=\"min-h-24 w-full rounded-md border border-gray-400 bg-white/90 px-3 py-3 leading-7 text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"adt-body leading-snug text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg023_n0040\">A mendoni se është e rëndësishme që t'i njohim kulturat e vendeve të ndryshme? Pse?</span></p><label for=\"activity-item-4\" class=\"sr-only\">A mendoni se është e rëndësishme që t'i njohim kulturat e vendeve të ndryshme? Pse?</label><textarea id=\"activity-item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"A mendoni se është e rëndësishme që t'i njohim kulturat e vendeve të ndryshme? Pse?\" class=\"min-h-32 w-full rounded-md border border-gray-400 bg-white/90 px-3 py-3 leading-7 text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500\"></textarea></div></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>","./pg024_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq-XK\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title>\n    <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg024_sec001\">\n    <!-- Despite the name, this is the page's 1-based position in the reading\n         order, not a section id and not the printed page number. It drives the\n         \"N of M\" dock counter and is re-emitted on every package, so it tracks\n         the current order. Identity lives in title-id above. -->\n    <meta name=\"