 gjëra/sende riciklohen?\" class=\"adt-body min-h-24 w-full rounded border border-purple-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea></div><div><label for=\"activity-item-3\" class=\"mb-2 block adt-body text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg120_n0049\">- Çfarë përfitojmë nga riciklimi i mbetjeve?</span></label><textarea id=\"activity-item-3\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-label=\"- Çfarë përfitojmë nga riciklimi i mbetjeve?\" class=\"adt-body min-h-24 w-full rounded border border-purple-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea></div><div><label for=\"activity-item-4\" class=\"mb-2 block adt-body text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg120_n0050\">- Trego një rast kur ke ricikluar.</span></label><textarea id=\"activity-item-4\" data-activity-item=\"item-4\" aria-label=\"- Trego një rast kur ke ricikluar.\" class=\"adt-body min-h-24 w-full rounded border border-purple-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea></div><div><label for=\"activity-item-5\" class=\"mb-2 block adt-body text-gray-900\"><span data-id=\"pg120_n0051\">- Jep një ide se si mund ta përdorim përsëri një shishe plastike.</span></label><textarea id=\"activity-item-5\" data-activity-item=\"item-5\" aria-label=\"- Jep një ide se si mund ta përdorim përsëri një shishe plastike.\" class=\"adt-body min-h-24 w-full rounded border border-purple-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-gray-900 outline-none focus:border-purple-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-200\"></textarea></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');\n    </script>\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\n        window.correctAnswers = JSON.parse('{\"item-1\":\"\",\"item-2\":\"\",\"item-3\":\"\",\"item-4\":\"\